### ================================================================
### FASE 9 — Disponibilidad de Horarios (AIB-10)
### Prerequisito: ninguno (standalone)
###
### Endpoints:
###   PUT /api/v1/students/schedule-availability  → Guardar disponibilidad (upsert)
###   GET /api/v1/students/schedule-availability  → Consultar disponibilidad actual
###
### Reglas de negocio:
###   - Todos los campos de horas son opcionales (nullable)
###   - Cada campo > 0.0 si se provee (@DecimalMin(value="0.0", inclusive=false))
###   - maxStudyHoursPerDay ≤ 15.0 (@DecimalMax)
###   - Suma total de horas no puede superar 24 (validación en use case)
### ================================================================

@baseUrl = https://aibert-academic-service-qa.yellowwave-cb2d91fc.centralus.azurecontainerapps.io
@studentId = test-student-123
@ct = application/json


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 1 — Consultar disponibilidad sin datos → 200 OK
# Espera: todos los campos null (o registro vacío)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET disponibilidad de test-student-123 antes de configurarla
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/schedule-availability
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 2 — Error: horas = 0 → 400 Bad Request
# Espera: error de validación @DecimalMin (value="0.0", inclusive=false)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT con freeTimeHours=0 (no cumple > 0)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/schedule-availability
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "freeTimeHours": 0,
  "restHours": 8.0
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 3 — Error: maxStudyHoursPerDay > 15 → 400 Bad Request
# Espera: error de validación @DecimalMax
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT con maxStudyHoursPerDay=16
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/schedule-availability
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "freeTimeHours": 4.0,
  "restHours": 8.0,
  "maxStudyHoursPerDay": 16.0
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 4 — Error: suma de horas supera 24 → 400 Bad Request
# Espera: { "success": false, "error": "La suma de las horas no puede superar 24", "code": 400 }
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT con suma de horas > 24
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/schedule-availability
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "freeTimeHours": 8.0,
  "restHours": 8.0,
  "personalTimeHours": 5.0,
  "socialTimeHours": 5.0,
  "maxStudyHoursPerDay": 8.0
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 5 — Guardar disponibilidad completa → 200 OK
# Suma: 4 + 8 + 2 + 2 = 16 ≤ 24  ✓   maxStudy=6 ≤ 15  ✓
# Espera: todos los campos persistidos; respuesta SIN studentId
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT disponibilidad completa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/schedule-availability
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "freeTimeHours": 4.0,
  "restHours": 8.0,
  "personalTimeHours": 2.0,
  "socialTimeHours": 2.0,
  "maxStudyHoursPerDay": 6.0
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 6 — Verificar que la disponibilidad se guardó → 200 OK
# Espera:
#   freeTimeHours        = 4.0
#   restHours            = 8.0
#   personalTimeHours    = 2.0
#   socialTimeHours      = 2.0
#   maxStudyHoursPerDay  = 6.0
#   (sin campo studentId en la respuesta)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET disponibilidad post-guardado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/schedule-availability
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 7 — Actualizar disponibilidad (upsert) → 200 OK
# Reduce horas de sueño; los campos no enviados quedan null
# Espera: solo freeTimeHours y restHours con valor; resto null
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUT disponibilidad parcial (upsert)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/schedule-availability
Content-Type: {{ct}}
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

{
  "freeTimeHours": 5.0,
  "restHours": 7.0,
  "maxStudyHoursPerDay": 8.0
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 8 — Aislamiento: student-otro tiene su propia disponibilidad → 200 OK
# Espera: disponibilidad vacía (independiente de test-student-123)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET disponibilidad de student-otro (aislamiento)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/schedule-availability
X-Student-Id: student-otro
